   GridBoxItemSize->{},
   RowsEqual->True],
  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"06947391-460f-41fc-ba6b-e7d39d7d4340"],

Cell["4. Every exact local-facet certificate", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"36946c8b-3c27-4561-b5d0-8ad6faca1e99"],

Cell["\<\
ScalefulQ is the conjunction of ExactLowerFacetQ, CompleteFacetRankQ, \
HiddenHierarchyQ and PositiveTransverseSuppressionsQ. The full PullbackChecks \
associations are retained in the accompanying WL result file.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"961474c0-a0a0-4551-b9ef-e8d4549bac13"],

